WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:03.810
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:04.080 --> 02:05.040
Zheng Yu?

3
02:07.680 --> 02:08.880
Why are you here?

4
02:10.080 --> 02:12.760
I just finished some experiments. I'm on my way home.

5
02:12.840 --> 02:14.000
Do you live here?

6
02:16.520 --> 02:18.280
-You're here for…? -Tutoring.

7
02:19.200 --> 02:21.280
Do you know where Building 14 is?

8
02:21.960 --> 02:22.800
Building 14?

9
02:28.760 --> 02:31.080
It's hard to find. I'll take you there.

10
02:34.560 --> 02:37.560
By the way, I forgot to give you this at the ward last time.

11
02:37.640 --> 02:38.800
Here you go.

12
02:46.000 --> 02:49.080
Was it because you saw this that you were curious?

13
02:54.400 --> 02:56.440
How much farther? Let's hurry.

14
03:04.560 --> 03:06.000
BLOCK A, BUILDING 014

15
03:07.800 --> 03:08.840
This is it.

16
03:10.040 --> 03:10.960
Thank you.

17
03:24.320 --> 03:25.160
Yanzhou?

18
03:26.240 --> 03:27.840
Why are you two together?

19
03:32.760 --> 03:33.720
This is my cousin.

20
03:35.760 --> 03:37.560
Do you know my tutor?

21
03:38.800 --> 03:41.480
No, we just happened to both be at the door.

22
03:42.040 --> 03:44.560
Here's your assignment. Stop making excuses.

23
03:45.280 --> 03:46.160
I'm leaving.

24
03:46.240 --> 03:48.000
Since you're Gao Xing's tutor,

25
03:48.600 --> 03:49.520
stay for dinner.

26
03:49.600 --> 03:51.120
Yanzhou, no!

27
03:51.200 --> 03:53.040
-No, thanks. -What's going on?

28
04:00.120 --> 04:02.440
Gao Xing's tutor delivered her assignment?

29
04:03.800 --> 04:04.640
Hello.

30
04:05.480 --> 04:06.720
Hello, ma'am.

31
04:17.120 --> 04:19.839
Don't be shy. Feel free to look around.

32
04:22.120 --> 04:23.240
Come in.

33
04:35.680 --> 04:39.960
ELEGANT CHAMBER OF FRAGRANT ORCHIDS CHEN YANZHOU

34
04:41.160 --> 04:42.800
My aunt said you could look around,

35
04:42.880 --> 04:44.880
and you really made yourself at home.

36
04:46.760 --> 04:49.440
Ms. Zhou, do you need help?

37
04:55.320 --> 04:57.080
Here. Do you have enough?

38
04:57.160 --> 04:58.680
Yes, thank you.

39
04:58.760 --> 05:00.840
I made these scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

40
05:00.920 --> 05:04.120
Of course, this is also the only dish I'm good at.

41
05:04.200 --> 05:05.440
Try it.

42
05:07.160 --> 05:08.440
Uncle,

43
05:08.520 --> 05:10.200
who cooks their signature dish

44
05:10.280 --> 05:11.960
and ends up making such a mess?

45
05:14.400 --> 05:15.840
You brat.

46
05:15.920 --> 05:16.800
You're so naughty.

47
05:17.640 --> 05:20.120
How could you embarrass me like that?

48
05:20.640 --> 05:23.040
I remember Yanzhou was a picky eater as a child.

49
05:23.120 --> 05:25.680
He wouldn't even touch scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

50
05:26.360 --> 05:27.920
Now that he has grown up,

51
05:28.000 --> 05:29.680
he's not as picky anymore.

52
05:30.360 --> 05:32.120
It doesn't sound like a compliment.

53
05:39.480 --> 05:40.760
I was wrong.

54
05:43.200 --> 05:44.600
Okay, all right.

55
05:51.240 --> 05:52.720
I thought we were strangers.

56
05:52.800 --> 05:55.520
If you hide here, won't you be exposed?

57
05:55.600 --> 05:57.040
I don't know what to say.

58
05:57.640 --> 05:58.920
Are my parents that scary?

59
05:59.640 --> 06:00.840
They're quite nice.

60
06:01.440 --> 06:03.880
If you ask me, your cousin is scarier.

61
06:05.880 --> 06:07.520
Is the fearless Ms. Zheng

62
06:07.600 --> 06:09.240
afraid of a senior high school student?

63
06:12.400 --> 06:13.720
Let me help you.

64
06:15.920 --> 06:16.880
What happened here?

65
06:19.200 --> 06:21.640
It's just a winter rash from the damp weather.

66
06:21.720 --> 06:23.240
I'll apply ointment later.

67
06:27.800 --> 06:29.000
Yanzhou,

68
06:29.080 --> 06:30.400
I ordered dry cleaning.

69
06:30.480 --> 06:33.200
I'll add your jacket that's on the sofa.

70
06:33.280 --> 06:35.280
-Okay. -Is there anything in the pockets?

71
06:35.360 --> 06:36.520
No…

72
06:40.600 --> 06:42.480
No, there is something here.

73
06:43.080 --> 06:44.200
What is it?

74
06:44.280 --> 06:46.440
Whose student ID card is this?

75
06:48.720 --> 06:50.360
Does it belong to your classmate?

76
06:54.880 --> 06:56.760
It's an upperclassman.

77
07:20.360 --> 07:22.240
Is your mom okay?

78
07:22.320 --> 07:23.480
She…

79
07:25.320 --> 07:28.360
Don't assume that a few conversations and a few meetings

80
07:28.440 --> 07:30.160
make us close friends.

81
07:30.240 --> 07:33.240
Don't you think that is a personal question?

82
07:51.280 --> 07:52.360
Wait!

83
07:54.000 --> 07:54.840
Wait.

84
07:54.920 --> 07:56.720
ROUTE 89

85
08:17.160 --> 08:20.360
STUDENT IDENTIFICATION CARD NAME: ZHOU GUANQI

86
08:51.520 --> 08:54.440
We were having a nice meal. Why did you have to bring her up?

87
08:54.520 --> 08:56.840
Now I've lost my appetite.

88
09:00.920 --> 09:02.880
Why did Chen Huimei tell you to come?

89
09:02.960 --> 09:05.080
There's no lesson today, but with you here,

90
09:05.160 --> 09:07.480
this feels like a tutoring session.

91
09:07.560 --> 09:10.080
Bear with it. She told me to come tomorrow too.

92
09:10.160 --> 09:12.880
Tomorrow is Lunar New Year's Eve. Why would you come?

93
09:12.960 --> 09:14.960
No, I have to teach her a lesson.

94
09:15.040 --> 09:17.520
If you went to your uncle's house for the holiday,

95
09:17.600 --> 09:18.880
your mom wouldn't worry.

96
09:19.520 --> 09:22.800
I don't want to spend the holiday at his place or with you.

97
09:22.880 --> 09:24.280
At dinner last time,

98
09:24.360 --> 09:26.560
you and your uncle seemed close.

99
09:26.640 --> 09:28.800
Why won't you go to his house?

100
09:28.880 --> 09:32.520
I'm afraid of saying the wrong thing around my aunt

101
09:32.600 --> 09:34.080
and ending up like last time.

102
09:36.080 --> 09:38.000
Whose student ID card is this?

103
09:38.880 --> 09:40.520
Does it belong to your classmate?

104
09:47.640 --> 09:50.080
Do you mean that day that we had dinner together?

105
09:50.160 --> 09:52.360
Yes. That day…

106
09:58.640 --> 10:01.240
Whatever. It's fine to tell you.

107
10:02.000 --> 10:03.440
Actually,

108
10:03.520 --> 10:05.000
that student ID card

109
10:05.080 --> 10:07.440
doesn't belong to some upperclassman.

110
10:07.520 --> 10:09.120
It's my other cousin's.

111
10:09.880 --> 10:12.560
My aunt's other son.

112
10:12.640 --> 10:14.240
His name was Zhou Guanqi.

113
10:15.160 --> 10:16.320
Six years ago,

114
10:17.400 --> 10:18.480
he passed away.

115
10:19.520 --> 10:21.080
It was a huge shock to my aunt.

116
10:21.160 --> 10:22.520
She fell ill.

117
10:23.280 --> 10:24.360
When she woke up,

118
10:24.960 --> 10:26.720
she forgot Guanqi.

119
10:28.880 --> 10:30.000
Forgot?

120
10:30.560 --> 10:32.600
Do you mean amnesia?

121
10:34.440 --> 10:36.280
The adults said

122
10:36.360 --> 10:38.000
it was from too much grief.

123
10:38.080 --> 10:40.240
In order to protect her,

124
10:40.320 --> 10:42.160
her mind blocked part of her memories.

125
10:42.880 --> 10:44.640
I've heard of this before.

126
10:44.720 --> 10:46.440
But it's usually temporary.

127
10:46.520 --> 10:49.440
After a while, the patient will recover their memories.

128
10:49.520 --> 10:51.280
I wouldn't know either way.

129
10:51.360 --> 10:55.720
Maybe my aunt is just more devastated than other people.

130
11:02.960 --> 11:04.320
Feels good to get it out.

131
11:04.920 --> 11:07.320
So did none of you ever tell her about this?

132
11:08.880 --> 11:11.080
My aunt is doing very well now.

133
11:11.160 --> 11:12.480
If it were you,

134
11:13.440 --> 11:14.400
would you tell her?

135
11:16.760 --> 11:20.400
If you ever see her in the neighborhood, remember to keep the secret.

136
11:26.360 --> 11:27.320
Yanzhou.

137
11:28.920 --> 11:31.000
Your grandma is coming to dinner tomorrow.

138
11:31.080 --> 11:32.800
Does this outfit look all right?

139
11:34.640 --> 11:37.400
You should wear bright colors more often. It looks good.

140
11:38.000 --> 11:39.760
Really?

141
11:39.840 --> 11:41.880
Take a picture for me.

142
11:44.080 --> 11:45.240
It's not turning on.

143
11:46.800 --> 11:48.240
Is the battery flat?

144
11:59.720 --> 12:01.480
It's still not responding.

145
12:01.560 --> 12:02.440
Is it broken?

146
12:04.080 --> 12:06.400
I'll take it to a repair shop.

147
12:06.480 --> 12:09.120
The stores are probably closed for the holidays.

148
12:09.200 --> 12:11.240
-What's wrong? -There has to be one open.

149
12:11.320 --> 12:13.720
You can wait a few days for the shops to open.

150
12:14.480 --> 12:16.040
-It's fine. -Mom.

151
12:19.600 --> 12:20.440
I'll go.

152
12:20.520 --> 12:21.600
It's cold out.

153
12:35.040 --> 12:35.920
Tutoring today?

154
12:37.120 --> 12:39.240
Gao Xing is home alone. Her mom worries.

155
12:40.360 --> 12:42.200
My aunt is busy this time every year.

156
12:42.280 --> 12:44.720
Gao Xing usually went to her dad's house.

157
12:45.320 --> 12:47.400
This year, it wasn't an option.

158
12:47.480 --> 12:48.720
By the way,

159
12:48.800 --> 12:52.200
is the phone repair shop next to the convenience store open?

160
12:52.920 --> 12:55.720
They should have closed for the holidays already.

161
12:56.440 --> 12:58.040
Do you need your phone repaired?

162
12:58.120 --> 12:59.520
It's my mom.

163
12:59.600 --> 13:01.880
Her phone isn't working, and she needs it.

164
13:01.960 --> 13:03.840
I checked nearby shops.

165
13:03.920 --> 13:04.920
They're all closed.

166
13:05.760 --> 13:06.600
It's okay.

167
13:06.680 --> 13:08.840
I'll keep searching farther.

168
13:11.360 --> 13:13.520
My ride is here. I have to go.

169
13:15.800 --> 13:16.840
Wait.

170
13:18.240 --> 13:20.280
I know a place that can fix it.

171
13:23.280 --> 13:28.840
APPLIANCE REPAIRS

172
13:28.920 --> 13:30.760
Wait here.

173
13:30.840 --> 13:32.360
I'll go inside to talk to him.

174
13:35.280 --> 13:36.480
It's five years old.

175
13:37.080 --> 13:39.520
It's never had a problem or its battery replaced.

176
13:40.120 --> 13:43.360
I'll pay any price if it can be fixed and all files preserved.

177
13:43.440 --> 13:44.840
I'll transfer it to you.

178
13:45.800 --> 13:46.800
Is there a passcode?

179
13:48.840 --> 13:52.160
Don't worry. That person has professional ethics.

180
13:53.440 --> 13:55.040
That's not what I meant.

181
13:55.120 --> 13:56.920
The passcode is 990508.

182
13:58.000 --> 13:58.880
Okay.

183
14:01.600 --> 14:04.560
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

184
14:04.640 --> 14:07.400
PROFESSIONAL CELL PHONE, COMPUTER, AND DIGITAL DEVICE REPAIR CENTER

185
14:09.400 --> 14:10.920
What took so long?

186
14:16.200 --> 14:17.360
A rare guest.

187
14:20.240 --> 14:22.040
-Can you fix it? -We're closed.

188
14:22.800 --> 14:23.640
Name your price.

189
14:31.320 --> 14:33.280
-Is it yours? -A classmate's.

190
14:34.720 --> 14:36.520
What classmate? Are you close?

191
14:37.280 --> 14:38.520
Can it be fixed?

192
14:39.600 --> 14:41.160
Pay a 300-yuan deposit.

193
14:48.120 --> 14:50.600
WeChat Pay, 100 yuan.

194
14:50.680 --> 14:51.680
Deposit of 100 yuan.

195
14:52.240 --> 14:56.360
I will message you about the phone's usage and passcode.

196
14:56.440 --> 15:00.400
Do not lose a single file in it. What time will it be ready?

197
15:02.800 --> 15:04.560
You just fire out orders.

198
15:04.640 --> 15:05.840
Look at what time it is.

199
15:05.920 --> 15:08.040
And you had to pick this hour.

200
15:08.120 --> 15:10.840
Why don't you go somewhere else? I'll keep the deposit.

201
15:12.120 --> 15:14.160
I wonder where you got the money.

202
15:18.960 --> 15:20.080
I found a repair shop.

203
15:21.880 --> 15:23.080
Zheng Yu knows them.

204
15:23.160 --> 15:26.080
Yes, Gao Xing's tutor.

205
15:27.640 --> 15:28.520
Okay.

206
15:29.280 --> 15:30.520
I'm hanging up.

207
15:42.400 --> 15:44.760
-How did it go? -You can pick it up this time tomorrow.

208
15:44.840 --> 15:47.080
Sis? Why are you here?

209
15:48.560 --> 15:50.160
The laptop is fixed.

210
15:53.320 --> 15:55.120
He didn't mention the laptop to me.

211
15:55.200 --> 15:57.200
Didn't you tell him whose it was?

212
15:57.280 --> 15:58.400
I didn't.

213
15:58.480 --> 16:00.760
On that page it was stuck at, there was a name.

214
16:00.840 --> 16:02.280
"Chen Yanzhou."

215
16:04.000 --> 16:06.160
I… I see.

216
16:11.480 --> 16:13.240
-I'm leaving. -Let's get dinner.

217
16:15.440 --> 16:16.560
No, thanks.

218
16:16.640 --> 16:18.680
-I can join you two. -Go home.

219
16:18.760 --> 16:20.080
What about tomorrow night?

220
16:30.880 --> 16:32.640
What did your brother mean?

221
16:32.720 --> 16:33.800
What name?

222
16:33.880 --> 16:36.160
When I was working on the competition slides,

223
16:36.240 --> 16:37.320
I mistyped.

224
16:37.400 --> 16:38.960
My brother saw it.

225
16:40.880 --> 16:42.680
Is my name that easy to type?

226
16:45.320 --> 16:47.440
Do you want your phone back or not?

227
16:59.200 --> 17:04.440
FORTUNE

228
17:09.440 --> 17:10.680
Ms. Zhou, what's up?

229
17:12.680 --> 17:13.560
Nothing.

230
17:13.640 --> 17:16.040
I'm just seeing if the decoration is crooked.

231
17:18.520 --> 17:20.280
It's perspective. Don't believe me?

232
17:21.000 --> 17:22.280
Look at it from here.

233
17:22.800 --> 17:23.760
You're right.

234
17:23.839 --> 17:25.000
Mom is here.

235
17:25.720 --> 17:27.280
-Mom, be careful. -Grandma.

236
17:28.440 --> 17:29.720
Hello.

237
17:31.280 --> 17:32.560
Dinner will be ready soon.

238
17:33.080 --> 17:35.520
Just two more dishes. Sit first.

239
17:36.480 --> 17:39.040
You don't have to make so much. We can't eat it all.

240
17:39.880 --> 17:42.280
I was thinking of ten dishes.

241
17:42.800 --> 17:44.360
A perfectly round number.

242
17:44.440 --> 17:45.560
For good luck.

243
17:45.640 --> 17:47.520
How can anything be perfect?

244
17:47.600 --> 17:48.600
-Xiao-- -Mom.

245
17:49.680 --> 17:52.200
Don't be angry. Come, sit.

246
17:52.800 --> 17:54.200
Calm down.

247
17:55.400 --> 17:56.240
Calm down.

248
18:00.280 --> 18:03.480
Mom is angry that there won't be chicken stewed with chestnuts.

249
18:03.560 --> 18:05.800
It won't be perfect without her favorite dish.

250
18:10.800 --> 18:13.040
I'll help you with the rest of the dishes.

251
18:16.920 --> 18:18.760
Yanzhou, keep your grandma company.

252
18:18.840 --> 18:19.680
Okay.

253
18:32.520 --> 18:34.040
How is your health?

254
18:35.160 --> 18:36.360
Pretty good.

255
18:37.280 --> 18:38.680
Your mom is really something.

256
18:38.760 --> 18:41.640
She birthed two kids but couldn't take good care of either.

257
18:42.320 --> 18:43.640
So…

258
18:43.720 --> 18:45.680
It's okay.

259
18:45.760 --> 18:46.840
Break in the new year!

260
18:46.920 --> 18:48.280
-It's okay. -Look at me.

261
18:48.360 --> 18:50.000
-It's okay. -I'm so clumsy.

262
18:50.080 --> 18:51.280
It's all right.

263
18:51.360 --> 18:52.720
It slipped and…

264
18:52.800 --> 18:55.440
Yes, that's what happens.

265
18:57.360 --> 18:59.160
How heartless.

266
19:02.400 --> 19:03.440
Can't she even laugh?

267
19:08.200 --> 19:09.040
She can.

268
19:09.120 --> 19:10.560
Why not?

269
19:11.560 --> 19:14.960
Your mom forgot that she is a very negligent mother.

270
19:15.040 --> 19:17.920
She forgot completely. Of course she can laugh out loud.

271
19:20.080 --> 19:23.080
The only one who is agonized is this old lady here.

272
19:23.160 --> 19:25.880
In order to accommodate your mother, for six years,

273
19:25.960 --> 19:28.760
I didn't even dare to speak my own grandson's name.

274
19:32.840 --> 19:34.560
Can't you bear with it?

275
19:35.360 --> 19:38.200
It's only one day a year when you need to cooperate.

276
19:42.080 --> 19:43.240
You make it sound

277
19:44.080 --> 19:45.240
like I'm in the wrong.

278
19:51.760 --> 19:53.000
Xiaozheng,

279
19:53.080 --> 19:57.040
tonight, do you want to eat freshly-wrapped dumplings

280
19:57.120 --> 19:58.440
or go out to eat?

281
19:58.520 --> 19:59.640
I've got an errand.

282
20:01.200 --> 20:02.760
On Lunar New Year's Eve?

283
20:03.680 --> 20:05.080
It's for a classmate.

284
20:06.080 --> 20:08.200
Which classmate is so inconsiderate?

285
20:08.280 --> 20:10.560
How could they send you on an errand today?

286
20:11.200 --> 20:12.440
Let me tell you,

287
20:12.520 --> 20:14.680
working overtime during holidays

288
20:15.320 --> 20:17.000
is triple the pay.

289
20:17.600 --> 20:20.160
Remember to up your price.

290
20:22.120 --> 20:23.080
Got it.

291
20:25.040 --> 20:25.880
Wait.

292
20:27.120 --> 20:28.920
Wear a scarf.

293
20:29.000 --> 20:29.840
Keep warm.

294
20:31.080 --> 20:32.280
Make money today

295
20:32.360 --> 20:34.120
to make a fortune next year.

296
20:37.240 --> 20:38.400
Thank you.

297
20:41.440 --> 20:43.280
Didn't you invite Gao Xing?

298
20:43.360 --> 20:46.000
I did. She said she ordered McDonald's.

299
20:48.400 --> 20:49.240
And your grandma?

300
20:50.400 --> 20:52.960
Why did she leave without eating dinner?

301
20:54.920 --> 20:57.920
Maybe because there isn't chicken stewed with chestnuts.

302
20:58.680 --> 20:59.960
Nonsense.

303
21:03.040 --> 21:04.440
That's just how my mom is.

304
21:05.120 --> 21:07.040
Maybe she went to play mahjong.

305
21:08.360 --> 21:11.080
Did you say something rude to her?

306
21:11.160 --> 21:13.320
If you did, call her and apologize.

307
21:17.600 --> 21:20.440
I'm full. I'm going out to pick up the phone.

308
21:34.760 --> 21:38.200
PROFESSIONAL CELL PHONE, COMPUTER, AND DIGITAL DEVICE REPAIR CENTER

309
21:48.760 --> 21:49.800
Here.

310
21:53.960 --> 21:55.400
Zheng Yu, why are you here?

311
21:56.000 --> 21:57.280
Sit and eat with us.

312
21:57.360 --> 21:58.400
No way.

313
21:59.040 --> 22:01.400
You drop by on Lunar New Year's Eve.

314
22:01.480 --> 22:04.560
You even came empty-handed. How rude.

315
22:05.720 --> 22:08.720
What's this? Only came to freeload?

316
22:08.800 --> 22:11.040
Do I owe your family or something?

317
22:11.120 --> 22:12.320
I'm your uncle,

318
22:12.400 --> 22:14.160
not your father.

319
22:16.000 --> 22:18.320
I came for the phone. I'll go after I get it.

320
22:24.760 --> 22:25.640
Also…

321
22:28.480 --> 22:31.600
what's the point of having your mom lying in rehab like that?

322
22:32.200 --> 22:33.400
It has been three years.

323
22:33.480 --> 22:35.680
She's hanging on by a thread.

324
22:35.760 --> 22:37.400
Yet, you spend beyond your means,

325
22:37.480 --> 22:39.120
hiring two caregivers for her.

326
22:39.880 --> 22:41.520
If you're so filial,

327
22:41.600 --> 22:43.200
take her home.

328
22:43.280 --> 22:45.520
You're her daughter. Care for her yourself.

329
22:47.120 --> 22:48.200
Have you found it?

330
22:56.320 --> 22:58.320
If she doesn't make it,

331
22:58.400 --> 22:59.480
that's her fate.

332
23:00.640 --> 23:01.480
Set her free.

333
23:03.240 --> 23:04.440
You ungrateful girl!

334
23:05.720 --> 23:08.320
Is she an ungrateful girl or what?!

335
23:09.040 --> 23:11.760
When you were chased and beaten for gambling debts,

336
23:11.840 --> 23:15.480
if my mom hadn't paid it off for you, you would have been crippled.

337
23:17.240 --> 23:18.760
I know you won't repay it.

338
23:19.360 --> 23:20.800
I'm also not asking you to.

339
23:21.440 --> 23:22.800
But I ask you

340
23:23.520 --> 23:24.880
to show respect to my mom.

341
23:32.760 --> 23:33.680
Also,

342
23:35.480 --> 23:38.440
you tell me to take my mom home and care for her.

343
23:40.160 --> 23:41.520
But, Uncle…

344
23:45.440 --> 23:46.920
do I have a home?

345
24:26.760 --> 24:28.160
Zheng Yu.

346
24:28.800 --> 24:30.680
-Don't follow me. -Zheng Yu.

347
24:31.400 --> 24:32.680
It's Lunar New Year's Eve.

348
24:32.760 --> 24:35.000
If you don't want to stay, I'll go with you.

349
24:38.000 --> 24:39.320
Every day, I care for Mom,

350
24:39.400 --> 24:41.920
go to class, make money, and pay off debts.

351
24:42.000 --> 24:43.840
I'm exhausted enough already.

352
24:43.920 --> 24:46.480
I don't have the energy to waste time with you.

353
24:48.160 --> 24:49.840
When our family was in trouble,

354
24:49.920 --> 24:52.320
Jiang Haixing still bought stuff for you monthly.

355
24:52.920 --> 24:54.800
When I asked to borrow money from him,

356
24:55.400 --> 24:57.200
he referred me to Wu Fa.

357
24:59.600 --> 25:01.640
Dad's side of the family

358
25:01.720 --> 25:03.600
would only take you out to eat.

359
25:04.680 --> 25:06.440
When we stayed at their place,

360
25:07.200 --> 25:08.960
they bought you a new bed.

361
25:09.040 --> 25:10.120
I slept on the floor.

362
25:11.680 --> 25:14.640
Having all this, you should behave.

363
25:16.840 --> 25:18.840
So what if it's Lunar New Year's Eve?

364
25:20.640 --> 25:23.360
It only makes me seem more pathetic.

365
26:12.240 --> 26:14.240
RED PACKET

366
26:23.320 --> 26:26.280
FROM XIAOMIAN

367
26:26.360 --> 26:28.400
Sis, happy Lunar New Year.

368
28:20.040 --> 28:22.400
I've heard that eating ice cream when you're unhappy

369
28:23.000 --> 28:24.480
can freeze your tears.

370
28:38.440 --> 28:39.520
You believe that?

371
28:40.760 --> 28:42.120
I was a kid.

372
28:42.200 --> 28:43.880
I believed anything people said.

373
28:59.800 --> 29:02.640
You and your uncle are clearly on bad terms.

374
29:02.720 --> 29:05.160
Why did you still help me fix the phone?

375
29:07.160 --> 29:08.600
You heard everything?

376
29:10.760 --> 29:13.600
When I arrived at the shop, I thought you hadn't come yet.

377
29:14.520 --> 29:17.760
The door was open, so I thought I would pick up the phone first.

378
29:18.480 --> 29:19.720
In the end,

379
29:19.800 --> 29:21.840
I heard you and your uncle fighting.

380
29:24.320 --> 29:25.200
Why help me?

381
29:27.040 --> 29:28.120
I wasn't helping you.

382
29:28.680 --> 29:29.880
I was helping your mom.

383
29:33.000 --> 29:34.280
Gao Xing

384
29:34.360 --> 29:35.960
told me about your mom.

385
29:40.960 --> 29:42.240
I didn't mean to pry.

386
29:43.720 --> 29:44.800
I didn't say anything.

387
29:48.600 --> 29:51.440
I was afraid you would say it's too personal again.

388
29:55.680 --> 29:56.680
You hold a grudge.

389
30:03.120 --> 30:05.800
I apologize for what I said before.

390
30:06.400 --> 30:07.720
It's not that serious.

391
30:11.600 --> 30:14.080
Then we're even now.

392
30:16.200 --> 30:17.640
What do you mean?

393
30:18.160 --> 30:20.480
You inquired about Zhou Guanqi.

394
30:20.560 --> 30:22.600
I went to the hospital ward uninvited.

395
30:23.560 --> 30:26.520
You unintentionally learned about my mom.

396
30:26.600 --> 30:29.960
I accidentally overheard you and your uncle.

397
30:30.520 --> 30:31.920
We're even.

398
30:36.440 --> 30:37.960
Is that how it's counted?

399
30:43.560 --> 30:44.680
It's snowing.

400
31:02.000 --> 31:03.120
Zheng Yu.

401
31:05.960 --> 31:07.280
Happy Lunar New Year.

402
31:10.080 --> 31:12.640
Happy Lunar New Year, Chen Yanzhou.

403
32:35.640 --> 32:38.560
Our city center square has a Lunar New Year's Eve event.

404
32:38.640 --> 32:41.000
I'm being squished to death!

405
32:41.080 --> 32:42.680
I'm so exhausted.

406
32:42.760 --> 32:44.480
Everyone is taking it easy.

407
32:44.560 --> 32:47.240
I told my dad not to make a big feast.

408
32:47.320 --> 32:49.040
It's best if he makes me a salad.

409
32:49.120 --> 32:51.960
He really did put together a few vegetable leaves.

410
32:52.040 --> 32:54.720
But there's no salad dressing, so he added chili sauce!

411
32:56.720 --> 32:58.360
Hilarious!

412
32:58.440 --> 33:01.360
If I said I was dieting during the holidays,

413
33:01.440 --> 33:04.320
my parents would definitely bite my head off.

414
33:04.400 --> 33:05.960
Mine too!

415
33:06.680 --> 33:09.040
Zheng Yu, are you home yet?

416
33:38.280 --> 33:41.640
It's the sixth day of the Lunar New Year. Can't you give me a break?

417
33:46.120 --> 33:48.440
MITOCHONDRIA MAIN SITE OF AEROBIC RESPIRATION

418
34:24.320 --> 34:27.000
Can we move the Lantern Festival session to tomorrow?

419
34:27.080 --> 34:28.360
No.

420
34:28.440 --> 34:30.760
You know I'm busy tomorrow and can't come.

421
34:32.520 --> 34:33.560
Your competition.

422
34:34.440 --> 34:35.760
That's too bad.

423
34:35.840 --> 34:38.199
Just give me the Lantern Festival off.

424
34:38.280 --> 34:41.560
No. I've already confirmed the schedule with your mom.

425
34:42.719 --> 34:46.679
Then let's take a photo of our lesson at home and send it to her.

426
34:46.760 --> 34:48.080
Then you can take me out.

427
34:48.159 --> 34:50.719
She will still pay you. You get money.

428
34:50.800 --> 34:52.440
I get to have fun.

429
34:52.520 --> 34:53.600
Everyone's happy.

430
34:53.679 --> 34:57.120
I don't know what's fun. You're asking the wrong person.

431
34:58.160 --> 35:00.960
Then I'll get Yanzhou to deal with you.

432
35:03.760 --> 35:05.280
Classmates, right?

433
35:06.080 --> 35:09.520
We just have a few classes together. We're not close.

434
35:10.600 --> 35:11.640
I was right.

435
35:19.880 --> 35:21.040
Zhuang Ning?

436
35:21.120 --> 35:22.600
Why are you back so early?

437
35:23.520 --> 35:25.480
I wanted to watch you compete.

438
35:26.080 --> 35:28.520
Us? Is that worth giving up your holiday for?

439
35:31.800 --> 35:33.080
Welcome.

440
35:37.720 --> 35:39.880
My mom packed my suitcase full of food.

441
35:39.960 --> 35:41.240
I barely have any clothes.

442
35:41.320 --> 35:44.160
I'm the opposite. I have two suitcases this time.

443
35:45.560 --> 35:47.000
I don't believe

444
35:47.080 --> 35:48.680
you wheeled them here yourself.

445
35:49.680 --> 35:52.680
Happy Lunar New Year, Xiaolizi.

446
35:52.760 --> 35:54.920
Here. This is for you.

447
35:57.440 --> 35:58.720
Zhuang Ning,

448
35:58.800 --> 35:59.920
this is for you.

449
36:00.000 --> 36:02.720
This is my hometown's specialty. It's delicious.

450
36:03.360 --> 36:04.240
Thank you.

451
36:04.320 --> 36:06.920
If hers is too spicy, use this to cancel it out.

452
36:08.800 --> 36:10.360
I didn't bring any specialties.

453
36:10.440 --> 36:11.720
That's okay.

454
36:12.400 --> 36:13.520
I brought teabags.

455
36:19.200 --> 36:20.720
Then I'll help myself.

456
36:24.680 --> 36:25.760
Thank you.

457
36:27.360 --> 36:28.400
Right.

458
36:34.320 --> 36:35.400
Are you sure?

459
36:35.480 --> 36:37.040
What if she gives it back?

460
36:37.760 --> 36:39.360
Why did you bring four portions?

461
36:41.240 --> 36:42.760
When I first came to school,

462
36:42.840 --> 36:44.600
I also brought a lot of snacks.

463
36:44.680 --> 36:46.800
But Zheng Yu didn't take anything.

464
36:46.880 --> 36:49.720
I later discovered that she stays here for the holidays.

465
36:49.800 --> 36:51.640
She never goes home.

466
36:51.720 --> 36:55.160
Since then, I haven't brought back any specialties.

467
36:55.880 --> 36:57.080
I felt like I shouldn't.

468
36:59.600 --> 37:02.120
During the break, I even asked in the group chat

469
37:02.200 --> 37:03.120
if she went home.

470
37:03.800 --> 37:05.920
That's enough. Let's not worry about it.

471
37:06.000 --> 37:07.680
Let's prepare for the competition.

472
37:23.920 --> 37:25.240
One, two, three.

473
37:25.320 --> 37:26.160
-Go! -Go!

474
37:26.240 --> 37:28.760
EXCELLENCE CUP COLLEGE STUDENT LIFE SCIENCES COMPETITION

475
37:46.080 --> 37:47.240
Zheng Yu.

476
37:47.960 --> 37:51.000
Zheng Yu, hurry inside. They're drawing lots soon.

477
37:52.880 --> 37:54.240
What is that?

478
37:57.400 --> 37:59.080
Where is Chen Yanzhou?

479
37:59.160 --> 38:00.680
He didn't say he was coming.

480
38:01.880 --> 38:03.760
Then who were you waiting for?

481
38:03.840 --> 38:05.600
I wasn't. Just getting some air.

482
38:06.640 --> 38:07.480
Over there.

483
38:07.560 --> 38:09.440
Who was so awful?

484
38:09.520 --> 38:11.400
How could they knock over our biggest patron--

485
38:12.000 --> 38:14.000
I mean, our biggest patroness?

486
38:17.920 --> 38:22.360
YE SHENG, CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF NINGSHENG BIOTECH

487
38:22.440 --> 38:24.760
No, you're being modest. Too modest.

488
38:24.840 --> 38:28.200
As expected of the industry's female elite.

489
38:30.880 --> 38:32.920
If Ms. Ye's schedule wasn't packed,

490
38:33.000 --> 38:34.800
this insignificant director

491
38:34.880 --> 38:36.920
wouldn't have the chance to be a judge

492
38:37.000 --> 38:38.600
with industry leaders like you.

493
38:38.680 --> 38:40.680
She truly is a wonder woman.

494
38:40.760 --> 38:43.800
No wonder she's still single.

495
38:44.320 --> 38:46.000
You can't say that carelessly.

496
38:46.080 --> 38:47.840
If the wrong person heard that,

497
38:48.440 --> 38:50.440
they would say we're being discriminatory.

498
38:50.520 --> 38:51.760
Yes, you're right.

499
38:52.280 --> 38:53.160
Wait.

500
39:00.600 --> 39:02.160
-Carry on. -Sure.

501
39:05.480 --> 39:06.680
See for yourself.

502
39:06.760 --> 39:08.320
I've been looking.

503
39:08.400 --> 39:11.640
I don't see a place card with the words "Cai Ronggen."

504
39:11.720 --> 39:13.520
I'm sorry.

505
39:13.600 --> 39:16.640
We only found out today that Ms. Ye wouldn't be coming.

506
39:16.720 --> 39:18.960
We didn't have time to prepare one. Please sit in her seat.

507
39:19.040 --> 39:21.720
We will have it replaced before the competition starts.

508
39:22.760 --> 39:23.640
Wait.

509
39:24.440 --> 39:26.640
Was I done yet? Did I say you could leave?

510
39:28.920 --> 39:30.800
Is this how the organizer should act?

511
39:31.560 --> 39:33.920
Yes, I'm here on behalf of Ms. Ye,

512
39:34.000 --> 39:35.840
but should you be so negligent?

513
39:36.600 --> 39:39.640
It's a small place card, and you drag your feet.

514
39:39.720 --> 39:41.280
Sorry, I'll get right on it.

515
39:41.360 --> 39:42.400
Hurry up!

516
39:43.560 --> 39:45.200
It's not like it's a credit card.

517
39:45.800 --> 39:48.960
Young people nowadays just do a sloppy job.

518
39:49.040 --> 39:50.440
They need disciplining.

519
39:51.480 --> 39:52.560
Zheng Yu, over here.

520
39:52.640 --> 39:53.720
Sit here.

521
39:58.000 --> 40:00.000
Zhuang Ning said she wanted to watch us.

522
40:07.840 --> 40:10.400
Is NingSheng BioTech a sponsor this year?

523
40:11.680 --> 40:12.960
The biggest sponsor.

524
40:13.040 --> 40:16.840
They might hold the fate of all the contestants in their hands.

525
40:34.320 --> 40:35.920
ZHENG YU PRESENTATION ORDER NUMBER

526
40:38.920 --> 40:40.240
MR. LI

527
40:42.720 --> 40:43.880
Where are you?

528
40:44.480 --> 40:46.560
-I'm in a traffic jam. -It's rush hour.

529
40:46.640 --> 40:48.640
It's expected. You should've left early.

530
40:51.080 --> 40:53.120
The campus is so close to home.

531
40:53.200 --> 40:55.800
As the saying goes, confidence breeds carelessness.

532
40:55.880 --> 40:56.960
Let me tell you,

533
40:57.040 --> 40:58.880
Zheng Yu was waiting for you.

534
40:58.960 --> 41:00.840
At least send her encouragement.

535
41:00.920 --> 41:01.760
I know.

536
41:08.120 --> 41:10.840
Sir, just let me off here. I'll bike there.

537
41:17.840 --> 41:23.080
ANY SUGGESTIONS OR CRITICISMS ARE WELCOME!

538
41:24.160 --> 41:26.200
Thank you for your brilliant defense.

539
41:26.280 --> 41:27.680
The next team is

540
41:27.760 --> 41:30.600
from Qing Yi University's College of Life Sciences.

541
41:30.680 --> 41:32.880
Their topic is a study on the immune-enhancing effect

542
41:32.960 --> 41:36.440
of particulate aluminum adjuvants based on the oil-emulsion adjuvant strategy.

543
41:36.520 --> 41:37.600
Their topic…

544
41:37.680 --> 41:38.520
Zheng Yu.

545
41:38.600 --> 41:40.800
…received high praise from their college's dean.

546
41:41.640 --> 41:43.160
Let's give a warm welcome to them.

547
41:53.000 --> 41:54.120
You've got this.

548
42:23.960 --> 42:25.640
CAI RONGGEN

549
42:46.560 --> 42:47.440
Hello, everyone.

550
42:47.520 --> 42:51.040
I'm Zheng Yu, from Qing Yi University's College of Life Sciences.
